## village-sequence

### Boys town and crafts

Stable ID: `village-sequence`

Window passage, two boys, town title, shoemaker and seamstress with foreground occlusion.

#### Implementation

- [village-motion.js](../../dist/village-motion.js) — SHA-256 `ec37f24763927275e79489a4bb1548cb79cfec4fada416108e819441a8adfaa9`; functions: `villageState` (line 4).
- [village-scene.js](../../dist/village-scene.js) — SHA-256 `f6556f3a8bc13e8005ce2edc4aec2697b3ff58a019edea96d5bf1c3e4b1122f5`; functions: `plate` (line 12), `record` (line 13), `veil` (line 14), `createVillageScene` (line 15), `room` (line 17), `crossing` (line 18).
- [village-director.js](../../dist/village-director.js) — SHA-256 `e90217ed5dd9bca19946b025a70d3ca7fe755a8d3a9e92830eadf2f096b23e5e`; functions: `villageTiming` (line 6), `extendVillageDuration` (line 11), `repaintVillage` (line 15), `loadVillageAssets` (line 16), `resetVillageAssets` (line 18).
- [precision-motion.js](../../dist/precision-motion.js) — SHA-256 `9eef0a37366ecd4bd54ad1de908080b8df90fb9887279ed4cf29026d82c8db28`; functions: `precisionState` (line 4).
- [precision-scene.js](../../dist/precision-scene.js) — SHA-256 `d86686feded321c87c8e4194001464c6b8c424b016b5e2d90fc3864429448ae0`; functions: `plate` (line 5), `record` (line 6), `createPrecisionVillage` (line 7).

