## war-destruction-collapse

### Explosion, falling poles and electrical wires

Stable ID: `war-destruction-collapse`

Broad fireball grows into dark smoke; electrical lattice drops, wires sag, sparks scatter and sky lightning flashes. Replace explosion and ruins independently; simple controls in Next sequence. Project-authored timed choreography, not a physics simulation. V62 matched room color and shelf, gray paper surround, photographic dark-road street, separate figure, pivoting supports and short-lived localized sparks. V63 calibrated portrait push, pre-rolled destruction, shared perspective camera and five conductor spans, bound salvage wires and darker terrain.

